# Project Overview

Personal portfolio website hosted on GitHub Pages.

## Stack

- Vite + React + TypeScript
- Material UI (`@mui/material`, Emotion, `@mui/icons-material`, Roboto via `@fontsource/roboto`)
- React Router with `HashRouter`
- Styling: MUI only (`src/theme.ts`, `sx` prop, MUI layout components) — no Tailwind or other CSS frameworks

## Pages

| Route | Page |
|-------|------|
| `/` | Home (PinUpBoard intro + linked preview cards) |
| `/skills` | Skills |
| `/projects` | Projects |
| `*` | NotFound |

More pages may be added later when explicitly requested.

## Workflow

- Only do what the user asks in each prompt
- Do not add extra pages, features, dependencies, or animations unprompted
- Ask before making significant decisions
- Prefer small, reviewable changes

## Docs

- At the start of a task, read `docs/PROJECT.md`
- When a task completes or a decision is made, update `docs/ROADMAP.md` and the Decisions log in `docs/PROJECT.md`
